  "description": "Reid Harrier 1.0 | Singlespeed Bike\nBuilt for everyday urban riding, the Reid Bikes Harrier 1.0 is one of our original bikes and a simple, reliable choice for getting around the city. With a lightweight frame and carefully selected components, it's designed to deliver a smooth, no-fuss riding experience with minimal maintenance.\nStripped back to the essentials, the Harrier 1.0 keeps things simple without compromising on quality. Its lightweight frame is nimble and resilient, making it easy to handle through busy streets and ideal for everyday commuting and getting around town.\nWhether you're commuting to work, cruising through the city or simply looking for an uncomplicated bike for everyday journeys, the Reid Bikes Harrier 1.0 is built to keep riding simple. Reliable, practical and easy to live with, it's an essential bike for urban life.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Harrier 1.0 for?\nThe Harrier 1.0 Singlespeed Bike is ideal for:\n\nCity-dwellers and urban riders\nRiders looking for a simple, reliable bike\nCommuters who want a low-maintenance ride\nCyclists who prefer the simplicity of singlespeed riding\nRiders looking for a lightweight and nimble bike\nEveryday journeys around town\nRiders who want a no-fuss alternative to a road bike\nAnyone looking for a practical bike for urban living",
